# Advisories `scripts/audit-gate.sh` will not fail on.
#
# ONE LINE PER ADVISORY: <GHSA-id> <whitespace> <why it is not reachable here>.
# Blank lines and `#` comments are ignored.
#
# Two rules make this an allowlist rather than a snooze button:
#
#   1. An advisory that is NOT listed here fails the gate. New findings are
#      loud by default; silence is something you have to write down.
#   2. A listed advisory that no longer appears ALSO fails the gate. A stale
#      entry is a fix nobody noticed and a waiver that outlives its reason —
#      delete it when the gate tells you to.
#
# "Not reachable" has to mean not reachable, not merely inconvenient. If the
# honest answer is "we should upgrade but it is awkward", the entry does not
# belong here; file it and fix it.
#
# Reviewed 2026-07-30 (bug 1206). Everything reachable from the shipped server
# or the shipped SPA bundle was FIXED rather than waived: @fastify/static
# 9.1.3 -> 10.1.2 (both route-guard and non-canonical-path bypasses),
# fastify 5.8.5 -> 5.10.0, react-router-dom 7.17.0 -> 7.18.1, plus pinned
# overrides for fast-uri 3.1.4 and find-my-way 9.7.0.

